# Every tracked file is stored and checked out with LF, on every platform.
#
# `pnpm check:contract` compares the committed contract artifacts byte-for-byte with a
# fresh generation, and the Windows CI runner checks the tree out with `core.autocrlf`
# enabled — so those two JSON files arrived with CRLF and the gate reported them "out of
# date" on Windows while passing everywhere else. Declaring the checkout here keeps the
# comparison platform-independent instead of teaching the gate to ignore line endings.
* text=auto eol=lf
